{"3196440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vacation Cafe Simulator", "steam_appid": 3196440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook Authentic Cuisine:</strong> Master traditional Italian recipes through engaging mini-games to prepare pizza, pasta, bruschetta, and more.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/f929283ed3de112f49878df97116c821.poster.avif?t=1787659614\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/f929283ed3de112f49878df97116c821.webm?t=1787659614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/f929283ed3de112f49878df97116c821.mp4?t=1787659614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop Your Restaurant:</strong> Invest your earnings to buy new equipment, expand your menu, and improve your restaurant's interior and ambiance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/ecedce52c987aa6f3cf3bb28ddd6b3fb.poster.avif?t=1787659614\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/ecedce52c987aa6f3cf3bb28ddd6b3fb.webm?t=1787659614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/ecedce52c987aa6f3cf3bb28ddd6b3fb.mp4?t=1787659614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the World:</strong> Visit nearby shops and locations like wineries and farms to discover new opportunities and add unique touches to your cafe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/8996d27006830ac308e9fa7d2f1c6305.poster.avif?t=1787659614\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/8996d27006830ac308e9fa7d2f1c6305.webm?t=1787659614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/8996d27006830ac308e9fa7d2f1c6305.mp4?t=1787659614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve Your Customers:</strong> Take orders, serve meals and drinks, and delight your customers with top-notch service to build a loyal following.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Experience:</strong> Combine management skills, culinary mastery, and the zest of exploration to build your dream gastronomic business.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a flavorful journey and turn your vacation cafe into the most beloved spot in town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of an Italian vacation cafe owner and craft the ultimate dining experience! In ‘<strong>Vacation Cafe Simulator</strong>,’ you'll manage a cozy restaurant, cook delicious Italian dishes, and serve your guests while immersing yourself in the authentic atmosphere of Italy.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook Authentic Cuisine:</strong> Master traditional Italian recipes through engaging mini-games to prepare pizza, pasta, bruschetta, and more.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://